# Two independent want-of-platform-support failures, both on the GStreamer MSE backend.
# (1) SourceBuffer.changeType is [EnabledBySetting=SourceBufferChangeTypeEnabled] (SourceBuffer.idl),
# and UnifiedWebPreferences.yaml defaults that setting false under USE(GSTREAMER) for WebKit and
# WebCore, so the call throws TypeError instead of NotSupportedError. WebKitLegacy's default has no
# USE(GSTREAMER) branch, so on --wk1 that line passes.
